# Python requirements of CDISC CORE (cdisc-rules-engine), which runs in its
# own virtual environment (docs/decisions/ADR-006.md). env/lock.sh resolves
# them into env/core-requirements.lock, which is what gets installed.
#
# This is the dependency list of pyproject.toml at the commit that
# env/core-source.txt pins, with the same bounds. One line is left out:
# pyinstaller, which builds the executable and is not imported when CORE
# runs from source.
